<title>USA: Cotton States Life Q3 shr rises to $0.36.</title>
<headline>Cotton States Life Q3 shr rises to $0.36.</headline>
<text>
<p>ATLANTA, Ga., Oct 28 (Reuter)</p>
<p>				1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.36		    $0.30</p>
<p> Net			  1,230		    1,023</p>
<p> Total income	     6,159		    5,933</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   3,406		    3,391</p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.06		    $0.91</p>
<p> Net			  3,611		    3,093</p>
<p> Total income	    17,629		   17,087</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   3,406		    3,391</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Full company name is Cotton States Life Insurance Co</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said earnings increased due to increased ordinary life premium income, mortality and expense charges, and investment income and earnigns from two brokerage units.</p>
<p>1995 share and per share amounts adjusted for Oct 1995 five-for-four stock split.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
